Ladybird compares the numeric device pixel ratio to the window’s
ratio of device pixels to CSS pixels. Blink evaluates it in
DevicePixelRatioMediaFeatureEval(), WebKit exposes it through
devicePixelRatioFeatureSchema(), and Gecko reads it from
eval_device_pixel_ratio().

Chrome 157.0.8103.79, Firefox 151.0, and WebKit 26.5 recognized the
plain, min and max forms with fractional numbers, and rejected a
resolution unit in place of the number.
